    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「そういう悠木くんも、顔赤くなってるけどね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「にしても……こうやって眺めてると、けっこう珍しい環境だから、あたしもスケッチしたいな～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「大雪とか降らないと、ぜったいにこのあたりじゃ見られないような光景だもんね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「氷像とか雪像もいろいろあるみたい。いいな～、あたしも描くだけじゃなくて、作りたい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
