    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ん～。絵をうまく見せる小技はいろいろあるけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「基本的に上達するためには描き続けるしかないんじゃないかなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「悠木くんだって、剣術の小技ばかり練習するわけじゃなくて、基本からしっかりやるでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
